 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Payables Financing with Taulia (7MG)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio67295d454941427e9cf7e1c3da44f17e\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio67295d454941427e9cf7e1c3da44f17e__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Taulia's Payables Financing offers three powerful tools to optimize your working capital and cash flow:</p>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio67295d454941427e9cf7e1c3da44f17e__loio56b219a41df941cea25c66e56a870410_ul_efz_pm3_ndc\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Dynamic Discounting: Offer early payments to suppliers in exchange for discounts on individual invoices</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Supply Chain Financing: Provide early payments to suppliers using third-party funds, preserving your cash reserves</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Virtual Cards: Simplify supplier payments, reduce fraud risk, and extend your working capital</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\">You can flexibly combine Dynamic Discounting and Supply Chain Financing to control when you use your own cash for discounts versus third-party funds to manage cash flow. This versatile approach allows you to tailor your payment strategy to your current financial needs and goals.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio67295d454941427e9cf7e1c3da44f17e__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio67295d454941427e9cf7e1c3da44f17e__loio56b219a41df941cea25c66e56a870410_ul_u5r_x35_zcc\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Replicate supplier master and payables transaction data to Taulia platform automatically</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Use Taulia to analyze your supplier spend</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Assign suppliers to Dynamic Discounting, Supply Chain Financing, or Virtual Cards on Taulia</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Let supplier request early payments per invoice</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Update invoices automatically based on the program</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Use standard payment run to clear and pay invoices as needed</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio67295d454941427e9cf7e1c3da44f17e__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio67295d454941427e9cf7e1c3da44f17e__loio56b219a41df941cea25c66e56a870410_ul_gxg_g35_zcc\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Improve your liquidity and cash flow by using Dynamic Discounting, Supply Chain Financing, or Taulia Virtual Cards</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Diversify funding sources through a multi-funder approach for Supply Chain Financing</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Strengthen your entire supply chain network by providing supplier the ability to get paid early</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>通过 Taulia 的应付账款融资 (7MG)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio67295d454941427e9cf7e1c3da44f17e\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio67295d454941427e9cf7e1c3da44f17e__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Taulia 的应付账款融资提供了三个强大的工具来优化您的运营资本和现金流：</p>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio67295d454941427e9cf7e1c3da44f17e__loio56b219a41df941cea25c66e56a870410_ul_efz_pm3_ndc\">\n       <li class=\"li\">动态折扣：向供应商提前付款以换取单个发票的折扣</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">供应链融资：使用第三方资金向供应商提前付款，保留您的现金准备金</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">虚拟卡：简化供应商付款，降低欺诈风险，并扩展运营资本</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\">您可以灵活组合动态折扣和供应链融资，以控制何时使用自己的现金进行折扣，何时使用第三方资金来管理现金流。这种通用的方法使您可以根据当前的财务需求和目标定制付款策略。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio67295d454941427e9cf7e1c3da44f17e__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio67295d454941427e9cf7e1c3da44f17e__loio56b219a41df941cea25c66e56a870410_ul_u5r_x35_zcc\">\n       <li class=\"li\">自动将供应商主数据和应付账款交易数据复制到 Taulia 平台</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用 Taulia 分析供应商支出</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将供应商分配到 Taulia 上的动态折扣、供应链融资或虚拟卡</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">允许供应商按发票请求提前付款</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">根据程序自动更新发票</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用标准付款运行，根据需要清算和支付发票</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio67295d454941427e9cf7e1c3da44f17e__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio67295d454941427e9cf7e1c3da44f17e__loio56b219a41df941cea25c66e56a870410_ul_gxg_g35_zcc\">\n       <li class=\"li\">使用动态折扣、供应链融资或 Taulia 虚拟卡提高流动性和现金流</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过供应链融资的多资金来源方法，使资金来源多样化</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">为供应商提供提前付款的能力，增强整个供应链网络</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
